WEBVTT

00:17:56.673 --> 00:18:00.976
You'd be stunned at the ridiculously
low levels of spending

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.715
on these innovative approaches.

00:18:03.183 --> 00:18:06.976
We do need the market incentives --
CO2 tax, cap and trade --

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.524
something that gets
that price signal out there.

00:18:09.881 --> 00:18:11.479
We need to get the message out.

00:18:11.503 --> 00:18:13.907
We need to have this dialogue
be a more rational,

00:18:13.931 --> 00:18:15.521
more understandable dialogue,

00:18:15.545 --> 00:18:18.076
including the steps
that the government takes.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.750
This is an important wish,
but it is one I think we can achieve.

00:18:22.416 --> 00:18:23.569
Thank you.

00:18:23.593 --> 00:18:30.593
(Applause)